  m_Name: RavenSpaceship
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exhibitName: Raven Spaceship
  description: "Raven-Class Starcraft (Model v.2) \nDigital Reconstruction \u2013
    Star Conflict Era \nThis exhibit presents a detailed digital model of the Raven-Class
    Starcraft, a lightweight tactical vessel commonly used during the Star Conflict
    Period, an era defined by rapid technological advancement and territorial expansion
    across the Outer Rim sectors. \nThe Raven-Class fighter is distinguished by its
    angular wing structure, reinforced alloy plating, and quad-engine propulsion
    system, which emitted four bright linear trails during high-speed travel. Its
    compact frame and aerodynamic design allowed exceptional maneuverability, making
    it a preferred craft for scouting missions, defensive patrols, and precision
    strike operations. \nCircular emblems visible on the wings represent fleet insignia
    of the period, suggesting the craft belonged to a coordinated military force.
    The Raven\u2019s engineering reflects the shift from heavy cruiser dominance
    to fast, efficient, pilot-driven spacecraft. \nThis digital rendering is part
    of the museum\u2019s Interstellar Technology Preservation Program, which aims
    to reconstruct historical starship designs for educational and cultural study.
    The model on display provides insight into the craftsmanship, combat strategy,
    and aesthetic principles that shaped spacecraft development during the Star Conflict
    Era. "
  images: []
